### Ejecutar con la API y MySQL iniciados. Sustituir IDs y fecha por datos reales.
@base = http://localhost:8080
@token = PEGAR_TOKEN_DEL_LOGIN

### Salud
GET {{base}}/api/salud

### Login
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"login":"admin@barberia.com","clave":"Admin123!"}

### Crear servicio
POST {{base}}/api/servicios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nombre":"Corte clásico","precio":7.50,"duracionMinutos":30,"activo":true}

### Crear cliente
POST {{base}}/api/clientes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nombre":"Samuel Orellana","telefono":"71234567","email":"samuel@example.com"}

### Crear barbero
POST {{base}}/api/barberos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nombre":"Eduard Ayala","telefono":"76543210","especialidad":"Corte y barba","activo":true}

### Crear cita: sustituir fecha por un día futuro de lunes a sábado.
POST {{base}}/api/citas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"clienteId":1,"barberoId":1,"servicioId":1,"inicio":"2030-01-07T09:00:00","observaciones":"Corte clásico"}

### Agenda
GET {{base}}/api/citas/agenda?fecha=2030-01-07
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Confirmar cita
PATCH {{base}}/api/citas/1/estado
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"estado":"CONFIRMADA"}

### Consultar servicios
GET {{base}}/api/servicios?buscar=corte&page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancelar cita
PATCH {{base}}/api/citas/1/estado
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"estado":"CANCELADA"}

### Eliminar cita cancelada
DELETE {{base}}/api/citas/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
